{
  "version": 1,
  "courseId": 4958062,
  "courseSlug": "remix-course",
  "courseTitle": "Remix.js - The Practical Guide",
  "sourceLanguage": "en",
  "targetLanguage": "zh-TW",
  "lectures": [
    {
      "id": "34674434",
      "title": "Getting Started with File-based Routing",
      "lectureOrder": 13,
      "videoOrder": 9,
      "sourceHash": "44bf68f365b26803f99285362fe31b788a64401189d493c5599daa12cca957e7",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.22,
          "end": 3.053,
          "en": "So what's the idea",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 3.053,
          "end": 5.76,
          "en": "behind the routes folder in this app folder?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 5.76,
          "end": 8.01,
          "en": "Well, as mentioned before in there,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 8.01,
          "end": 10.41,
          "en": "we basically define the different routes,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 10.41,
          "end": 11.437,
          "en": "so the different pages",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 11.437,
          "end": 15.51,
          "en": "we want to support as part of our overall web application",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 15.51,
          "end": 18.54,
          "en": "of our overall website, you could say.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 18.54,
          "end": 21.66,
          "en": "And we start with one single file in there right now,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 21.66,
          "end": 25.77,
          "en": "the index.jsx file, which basically is our homepage,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 25.77,
          "end": 27.873,
          "en": "the starting page of this website.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 28.8,
          "end": 30.69,
          "en": "Now we get some dummy content in there",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 30.69,
          "end": 34.29,
          "en": "and the exact content might change over time.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 34.29,
          "end": 36.51,
          "en": "So when you create a new Remix project,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 36.51,
          "end": 38.43,
          "en": "this content might be different.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 38.43,
          "end": 39.87,
          "en": "But that's not too important",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 39.87,
          "end": 43.2,
          "en": "because I'm going to delete all this content here anyways.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 43.2,
          "end": 47.817,
          "en": "And instead add a single h1 element and say, \"Hello World!\"",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 48.69,
          "end": 50.94,
          "en": "Now please note that this here in the end",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 50.94,
          "end": 54.12,
          "en": "is a regular React component function.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 54.12,
          "end": 58.02,
          "en": "It's a function that returns jsx code that is the definition",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 58.02,
          "end": 60.273,
          "en": "of a react component function, essentially.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 61.14,
          "end": 64.74,
          "en": "It's exported as a default and, that's the important part,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 64.74,
          "end": 68.01,
          "en": "it's stored in a file in the routes folder.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 68.01,
          "end": 70.71000000000001,
          "en": "And any files you put into this routes folder",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 70.71000000000001,
          "end": 74.58,
          "en": "will be treated as separate routes by Remix.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 74.58,
          "end": 76.62,
          "en": "So where with React router,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 76.62,
          "end": 79.98,
          "en": "if you're using that package in a regular React app.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 79.98,
          "end": 84.42,
          "en": "so in a non Remix app, you have to define your routes.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 84.42,
          "end": 87.57,
          "en": "For example with Create Browser Router,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 87.57,
          "end": 90.96000000000001,
          "en": "you instead define Routes by creating separate files,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 90.96000000000001,
          "end": 95.00999999999999,
          "en": "one for every route in that routes folder in the app folder.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 95.00999999999999,
          "end": 96.99000000000001,
          "en": "Now index is a special filename",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 96.99000000000001,
          "end": 99.12,
          "en": "which here defines the starting page",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 99.12,
          "end": 101.37,
          "en": "of this overall website.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 101.37,
          "end": 103.77000000000001,
          "en": "But I could add a second file here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 103.77000000000001,
          "end": 106.32300000000001,
          "en": "For example, demo.jsx.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 107.16,
          "end": 111.03,
          "en": "And then in there export endeavor default function",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 111.03,
          "end": 113.13,
          "en": "called DemoPage for example.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 113.13,
          "end": 116.78999999999999,
          "en": "The name of this component function does not matter.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 116.78999999999999,
          "end": 119.94,
          "en": "Where I return h1 Demo Page.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 119.94,
          "end": 121.83,
          "en": "So where I also output a title",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 121.83,
          "end": 124.08,
          "en": "that contains the text Demo Page.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 124.08,
          "end": 126.9,
          "en": "With that, I would've created a second route,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 126.9,
          "end": 130.53,
          "en": "a second page basically on this overall website",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 130.53,
          "end": 132.333,
          "en": "besides this starting page.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 133.29,
          "end": 134.97,
          "en": "Now to see this in action,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 134.97,
          "end": 137.13,
          "en": "we should open the terminal again.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 137.13,
          "end": 138.99,
          "en": "And here I'm using the one integrated",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 138.99,
          "end": 143.16,
          "en": "into Visual Studio Code, but it's my default terminal still.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 143.16,
          "end": 145.32,
          "en": "And I'll run npm run dev.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 145.32,
          "end": 148.07999999999998,
          "en": "And that's this dev server executed",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 148.07999999999998,
          "end": 151.203,
          "en": "with help of this dev script which I mentioned before.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 152.31,
          "end": 155.85,
          "en": "If we run this, development server will start up",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 155.85,
          "end": 158.192,
          "en": "on the URL you see here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 158.192,
          "end": 162.54,
          "en": "And if you visit this URL, you see your website.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 162.54,
          "end": 164.46,
          "en": "And out of the box, we of course end up",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 164.46,
          "end": 166.68,
          "en": "on this starting page of this website.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 166.68,
          "end": 171.57,
          "en": "Therefore here if I zoom in a bit, we see Hello World!",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 171.57,
          "end": 172.98,
          "en": "And we see Hello World because",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 172.98,
          "end": 176.103,
          "en": "that's of course the content of this starting page route.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 177.57,
          "end": 180.03,
          "en": "Now if I do edit this URL though",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 180.03,
          "end": 182.82,
          "en": "and I add slash demo thereafter,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 182.82,
          "end": 184.713,
          "en": "I end up on this Demo Page.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 185.91,
          "end": 189.81,
          "en": "I end up there because I entered demo here slash demo.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 189.81,
          "end": 193.71,
          "en": "So demo is the path I added to my domain here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 193.71,
          "end": 196.86,
          "en": "And since I named this file here demo.jsx,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 196.86,
          "end": 199.68,
          "en": "this loads this component here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 199.68,
          "end": 202.82999999999998,
          "en": "Now if I would enter any other name here, like ABC.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 202.82999999999998,
          "end": 206.52,
          "en": "I get an error, a 404 error to be precise,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 206.52,
          "end": 208.53,
          "en": "because I haven't defined any file",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 208.53,
          "end": 211.65,
          "en": "with the name ABC in my Routes folder.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 211.65,
          "end": 213.36,
          "en": "So these filenames matter.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 213.36,
          "end": 216.45,
          "en": "They define for which path a certain route is loaded",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 216.45,
          "end": 218.22,
          "en": "and indexes a special filename",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 218.22,
          "end": 220.8,
          "en": "representing the starting page here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 220.8,
          "end": 224.733,
          "en": "But that's how routing generally works with Remix.",
          "zh": ""
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "errors": []
}
